<div class="dep-years-panel is-collapsed"><h2>Depreciation schedule</h2><p class="dep-years-sub" id="dep-schedule-sub">Straight-line over 27.5 years with the mid-month convention — the first and last years are part-years; every year between is a full year.</p><div class="dep-table-wrap" tabindex="0"><table class="dep-table"><thead><tr><th>Tax year</th><th>Depreciation</th><th>Accumulated</th><th>Remaining basis</th></tr></thead><tbody id="schedule-body"></tbody></table></div><div class="schedule-toggle"><button type="button" class="tool-btn tool-btn-outline" id="schedule-toggle-btn">Show full schedule</button></div></div>
